<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Effect of value-based diffusion models</h3>

<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle ltx_align_floatright" style="width:165.6pt;">
<table id="A1.T5.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
